A round brilliant diamond is the most versatile stone a man can wear in a ring. It has 57 or 58 facets — more than any other shape. It reflects light equally from every orientation. There is no wrong angle on a round stone. That matters on a men's band.

A men's band rotates more than a women's ring. It sits on a wider finger. A princess stone can read as a diamond from one angle and a square from another. A round stone looks correct from every view. Every certified men's setting in this category was designed around a round brilliant. The prong geometry, channel spacing, and geometric frames all assume a round stone.

