## The Round Ratio

The Round Ratio is the relationship between a round brilliant stone's face-up diameter and the men's band it sits in. Round brilliant stones are unique in one way. Their diameter is predictable from carat weight. [GIA](https://www.gia.edu/) enforces consistent proportions on round brilliants — a standard that does not apply to fancy shapes.

This predictability makes the round brilliant the only shape you can accurately size to a band before you buy.

Here are the GIA-standard face-up diameters for round brilliants at common carat weights:

| Carat Weight | Face-Up Diameter | Band Coverage (7mm) | Best Band Width | What this means |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 0.33 ct | ~4.4mm | 63% | 6–7mm | Visible but subtle; accent-tier |
| 0.50 ct | ~5.1mm | 73% | 7mm | Clear presence from 10 feet |
| 0.75 ct | ~5.9mm | 84% | 7–8mm | Strong statement; near-ideal for 7mm band |
| [0.90 ct — GIA natural from $2,487](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/26429485?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | ~6.3mm | 90% | 7mm | Dominant presence; correct coverage on men's standard width |
| [1.00 ct — GIA natural from $3,230](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29090690?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | ~6.5mm | 93% | 7mm | Maximum certified single-stone for 7mm band |
| [1.50 ct — IGI lab from $1,930](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28134308?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | ~7.4mm | 106% | 7–8mm | Oversized for 7mm; perfect for 8mm Structured Solitaire |

**Verdict:** The Round Ratio shows that 0.90–1.0 ct natural rounds (6.3–6.5mm face-up) are the ideal range for 7mm men's solitaire settings — 90–93% band coverage. The lab-grown 1.5 ct at $1,930 covers a 7mm band completely. Pair the [1.5 ct IGI lab round at $1,930](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28134308?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) with a [Structured Solitaire at $1,732](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/mens-structured-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-item-147399?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) for a $3,662 complete ring. The same D-VVS1 quality in natural would run $6,000+.

