**Verdict:** Most buyers default to precision (Signal 2) because solitaire matches the mental image of an engagement ring. If you want a ring that requires no stone decision and reads unmistakably masculine, go Signal 3 (Channel). If you want maximum design impact, go Signal 4 (Geometric). The taste signal framework cuts through the choice — pick the signal that matches your daily environment.

