## Expert Summary

**Farzana Hasan, diamond expert** | [About Farzana](/about-farzana/)

The round brilliant is the right choice for every men's ring setting in this category. It has the highest light return of any cut shape, works in every orientation on a wide band, and was the design intent behind every certified setting in this inventory.

The two decisions that matter: setting type and stone budget. Solitaire buyers need a separate stone budget. Channel buyers do not. The 4 Taste Signals framework cuts through the choice. Restraint means grooved solitaire. Precision means structured solitaire. Confidence means channel set. Daring means geometric statement.

Entry point: [$1,000](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/mens-tapered-grooved-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-item-147386?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) for a solitaire setting (stone extra). Complete channel ring with round brilliants included: [$2,088](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/mens-round-diamond-channel-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-1-3-ct-tw-item-147393?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational). Statement tier: [$2,404–$3,660](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings?Genders=men&ShapeID=Round&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational).

